msgid ""
"Input data does not seem to be a square matrix! Please check the format of "
"the input data."
msgstr "輸入的資料並非方陣！請確認資料。"

msgid ""
"Input data does not seem to be a symmetric matrix! Please check the format "
"of the input data and possibly the order of the variables."
msgstr ""
"輸入資料似乎不是一個對稱矩陣！請檢查輸入資料的格式，以及變數的順序是否正確。"

msgid "All cells must be numeric."
msgstr "所有細格內容皆須為數字。"

msgid "Too many %1$s requested (%2$i) for the amount of included variables"
msgstr "請求的 %1$s 數量過多（%2$i），相對於已納入的變數數量不足"

msgid "Not enough valid cases (%i) to run this analysis"
msgstr "因樣本數不足 (%i) 而無法執行此分析"

msgid "Data not valid: variance is zero in each row"
msgstr "無效資料: 每列的變異數皆為零"

msgid "Data not valid: there are more variables than observations"
msgstr "無效資料: 變項數多於樣本數"

msgid "Data not valid: too many missing values in variable(s) %s."
msgstr "資料無效: %s 變數的遺漏值過多。"

msgid "Data not valid: all variables are collinear"
msgstr "資料無效: 所有變數互為共線性"

msgid "Component Loadings"
msgstr "成分負荷量"

msgid "Applied rotation method is %s."
msgstr "轉軸法為%s。"

